{"ID":"20250918120456-i953wrc","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250918120456-i953wrc","title":"UPL5-12——资源加载（反序列化）优化和预渲染","type":"doc","updated":"20250918154559"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918152945-heyh2rf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918152945-heyh2rf","updated":"20250918154559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250918152957-yxs78k3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918152957-yxs78k3","updated":"20250918154559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 着色器变体集合相关\nShaderVariantCollection\t\t\t\t\t// 着色器变体集合\nshaderVariantCollection.isWarmedUp\t\t// 判断着色器变体集合是否已经预热\nshaderVariantCollection.WarmUp()\t\t// 预热着色器变体集合内所有着色器变体\n// 渲染指令缓冲区相关\nmaterial.FindPass()\t\t\t\t\t\t// 通过渲染通道名字获取此渲染通道在材质中的索引\nCommandBuffer\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 指令缓冲区\nShader.PropertyToID()\t\t\t\t\t// 通过字符串指定一个唯一的着色器属性整数ID\ncommandBuffer.GetTemporaryRT()\t\t\t// 申请一个临时RenderTexture（指定ID、宽高、指定其 MSAA、ARGB32 格式）\ncommandBuffer.SetRenderTarget()\t\t\t// 为指令缓冲区设置渲染目标\ncommandBuffer.ClearRenderTarget()\t\t// 将渲染目标上的颜色和深度清空\ncommandBuffer.DrawRenderer()\t\t\t// 指定渲染器，材质，子网格索引，渲染通道，对渲染目标渲染内容\nGraphics.ExecuteCommandBuffer()\t\t\t// 执行指令缓冲区，将指令提交给GPU\ncommandBuffer.ReleaseTemporaryRT()\t\t// 释放指令缓冲区临时申请的RenderTexture\ncommandBuffer.Release()\t\t\t\t\t// 释放指令缓冲区\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250918135553-lps5c70","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918135553-lps5c70","updated":"20250918135750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源加载或反序列化为什么会带来开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918120607-ktebzhf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250918120607-ktebzhf","updated":"20250918123328"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123256-im42ez9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123256-im42ez9","updated":"20250918123326"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123256-8dhrvbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123256-8dhrvbq","updated":"20250918123326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源加载："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Resources"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 加载、AB 包加载、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Addressables"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 加载、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"UnityWebRequest"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 加载、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WWW"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 加载、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"File"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 加载 等等"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123257-knpe1cc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123257-knpe1cc","updated":"20250918123328"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123257-bq65ran","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123257-bq65ran","updated":"20250918123328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反序列化数据：Json、XML、二进制、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ScriptableObject"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等等"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918120607-ze66xzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918120607-ze66xzt","updated":"20250918123158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在进行资源加载或反序列化时带来的主要开销有："}]},{"ID":"20250918123159-kghs06v","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123159-kghs06v","updated":"20250918135639"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123206-al5wicx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123206-al5wicx","updated":"20250918135639"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123206-ncsftsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123206-ncsftsa","updated":"20250918135639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"I/O 开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918123207-n74q5jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123207-n74q5jk","updated":"20250918123212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"磁盘或网络读取会有 I/O 等待，等待数据从磁盘或网络加载到内存\n这个过程会阻塞 CPU（特别是同步加载时）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123206-ibkoqja","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123206-ibkoqja","updated":"20250918123206"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123206-6lxgsrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123206-6lxgsrs","updated":"20250918123206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解析开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918123214-3sqsa4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123214-3sqsa4k","updated":"20250918123227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加载成功后又需要进行数据解析或反序列化，用于匹配内部类的结构\n对于部分资源可能还会存在解压缩过程（比如 AssetBundle 包的 LZ4 和 LZMA 格式）\n反序列化时可能还会用到字符串解析、反射等等手段进行处理"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123206-jkqjkxl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123206-jkqjkxl","updated":"20250918123249"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123206-7ivrudx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123206-7ivrudx","updated":"20250918123206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存分配初始化开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918123233-extp3m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123233-extp3m2","updated":"20250918123249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于一些资源对象，我们需要分配 C++ 引擎对象（比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Mesh"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Texture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"AnimationClip"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等等）\n并且还需要对应对象进行初始化，这个过程也会带来消耗"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918120607-qcpad02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918120607-qcpad02","updated":"20250918135750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总的来说\n资源加载和数据反序列化会吃 CPU，是因为它们本质上是把文件里的原始字节流转化为可用对象的过程\n涉及 I/O、解压、解析、内存分配和类型初始化\n这些工作目前只能由 CPU 完成，而且往往集中在主线程执行，所以会造成明显的性能开销\n这个过程可以简单整理为 读文件（读取） —\u003e 变对象（解析） —\u003e 进场景（实例化）\n因此我们主要的优化思路就是把这个过程做得更轻、更分散、更可复用"}]},{"ID":"20250918135611-5upvv59","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918135611-5upvv59","updated":"20250918135836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本优化思路"}]},{"ID":"20250918123348-jeheqsw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918123348-jeheqsw","updated":"20250918135836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减小序列化对象"}]},{"ID":"20250918123403-1i7u2rm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123403-1i7u2rm","updated":"20250918123408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路：让需要被读出来的对象体积更小、结构更简单，这样解析就会更快，计算压力就会更低"}]},{"ID":"20250918123403-3hdavny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123403-3hdavny","updated":"20250918123413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20250918123413-hf0sooc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123413-hf0sooc","updated":"20250918135836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123413-lc2fi73","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123413-lc2fi73","updated":"20250918123413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123413-mlxahx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123413-mlxahx4","updated":"20250918123419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 中的预设体尽量做得简单，通过组合的形式加载，让预设体更精简，可以提升解析、实例化速度"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123415-tvl6ssz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123415-tvl6ssz","updated":"20250918135836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123415-3v40f0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123415-3v40f0f","updated":"20250918135806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配置文件尽量用二进制代替文本配置（Json、XML 等），让配置文件体积更小，结构更简单，可以提升处理效率"}]},{"ID":"20250918135810-dc943o9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918135810-dc943o9","updated":"20250918135836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二进制文件相关内容，可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230822030648-nlwzbet","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UD4——二进制系列"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123433-88djni7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918123433-88djni7","updated":"20250918135906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"公共数据配置化"}]},{"ID":"20250918123450-a1credv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123450-a1credv","updated":"20250918123512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路：\n把游戏中会常用的公共数据做成配置文件的形式，游戏中保证只存在一份，并一般在游戏初期加载解析他们\n当有模块或对象要使用这些数据时直接使用它们即可，可以避免重复加载，并且可以减少数据冗余"}]},{"ID":"20250918123454-p0q1e0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123454-p0q1e0f","updated":"20250918123517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20250918123517-5j9ob1a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123517-5j9ob1a","updated":"20250918135906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123517-mpt24oe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123517-mpt24oe","updated":"20250918123517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123517-w38nqok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123517-w38nqok","updated":"20250918123517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物品配置中包含所有物品的各种信息（ID、图标、模型、名称、价格、品质、各属性 等等）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123517-h6jg1my","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123517-h6jg1my","updated":"20250918135906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123517-qn0mgyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123517-qn0mgyh","updated":"20250918135906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏中表示物品信息时只需要一个 ID，通过 ID 在该表中找到对应的各种数据来使用"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123526-oxsxynn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918123526-oxsxynn","updated":"20250918123605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异步加载 + 分帧实例化"}]},{"ID":"20250918123533-qrqz71f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123533-qrqz71f","updated":"20250918123541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路：不要在主线程同步卡着等待，而是通过异步 API 加载资源（避免主线程阻塞卡顿），并且加载成功要实例化时分帧处理（避免主线程阻塞卡顿）"}]},{"ID":"20250918123542-fl5rw8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123542-fl5rw8x","updated":"20250918123602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例：\n利用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Resources"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、AB包、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Addressables"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"UnityWebRequest"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等加载方式中的异步方法加载资源，\n资源加载成功后，当需要实例化 n 个对象时分多帧去进行处理"}]},{"ID":"20250918123605-ftmky71","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918123605-ftmky71","updated":"20250918140128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缓存"}]},{"ID":"20250918123621-2i5idya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123621-2i5idya","updated":"20250918123638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路：把付出昂贵代价加载出来的结果暂存在内存中，下次直接复用，相当于用内存换性能"}]},{"ID":"20250918123635-c4n2w3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123635-c4n2w3t","updated":"20250918123643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例：\n对于资源对象，我们可以用合适的容器将其缓存在内存中，下次如果还要使用，直接获取使用即可\n对于已经实例化的场景中的对象，我们可以利用缓存池不停复用它们"}]},{"ID":"20250918140101-5p51lzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140101-5p51lzu","updated":"20250918140128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于缓存池实现，可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240415173226-4jovay9","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UFL3——缓存池（对象池）模块"}]},{"ID":"20250918123625-qkt8yyp","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250918123625-qkt8yyp","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250918123627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250918123627-ipz0euu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123627-ipz0euu","updated":"20250918123627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：缓存内容要在合适的时候进行清理，避免内存泄漏"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123657-mdwqjee","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918123657-mdwqjee","updated":"20250918123828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预热"}]},{"ID":"20250918123711-166t4ak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123711-166t4ak","updated":"20250918123720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路：在玩家不敏感的时机（过场景的加载界面等），提前准备将要使用的资源"}]},{"ID":"20250918123716-dawd16n","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123716-dawd16n","updated":"20250918140307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123716-oplieo7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123716-oplieo7","updated":"20250918123727"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123716-urkcvtj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123716-urkcvtj","updated":"20250918123727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预加载资源：解决 I/O 和反序列化消耗"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123716-5kbclli","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123716-5kbclli","updated":"20250918123716"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123716-91gsre4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123716-91gsre4","updated":"20250918123716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预实例化资源：解决内存分配和初始化脚本的消耗"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123716-yrkhqv4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123716-yrkhqv4","updated":"20250918140307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123716-glzcidd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123716-glzcidd","updated":"20250918140307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预渲染资源：解决 CPU 到 GPU 的首帧上传和 Shader 编译（把内存中纹理、网格、Shader 等上传到 GPU）消耗"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123714-g75z13u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123714-g75z13u","updated":"20250918123741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20250918123741-esrsnie","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123741-esrsnie","updated":"20250918123828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123741-0fwf2x8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123741-0fwf2x8","updated":"20250918123741"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123741-ygrz8he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123741-ygrz8he","updated":"20250918123748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预加载资源：在加载界面时，利用同步或异步 API 预加载资源（可缓存下来）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123741-5boub0d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123741-5boub0d","updated":"20250918123741"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123741-6yxfh5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123741-6yxfh5q","updated":"20250918123749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预实例化资源：利用预加载的资源将即将使用的预设体预实例化出来，并且最好放入缓存池（对象池）中"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123741-7athkko","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123741-7athkko","updated":"20250918123828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123741-zu085d3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123741-zu085d3","updated":"20250918123758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预渲染资源：利用预实例化的资源进行预先渲染"}]},{"ID":"20250918123758-qnndoop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123758-qnndoop","updated":"20250918123810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了避免预渲染时被主摄像看到，影响玩家体验，一般会采用："}]},{"ID":"20250918123810-p3dj57g","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123810-p3dj57g","updated":"20250918123828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123810-fu5rcqb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123810-fu5rcqb","updated":"20250918123833"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123810-uqe9r1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123810-uqe9r1i","updated":"20250918123833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"隐藏相机 + "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTexture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250918123830-o6k90uz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123830-o6k90uz","updated":"20250918123830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用一个摄像机使用渲染纹理进行渲染，将想要预渲染的对象放在该摄像机可视范围内\n在加载协程中多等待几帧，用于渲染对象\n比较适用于动画、粒子等资源预渲染，因为可以进行多帧渲染"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123813-0b3mpsn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123813-0b3mpsn","updated":"20250918123828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123813-qr6kucf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123813-qr6kucf","updated":"20250918123825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 Unity API 进行预渲染"}]},{"ID":"20250918123828-s80koam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123828-s80koam","updated":"20250918123828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CommandBuffer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Graphics.DrawMesh"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 进行预渲染\n比较适用于只想上传网格、纹理、Shader变体、材质的情况"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123846-0543zp8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918123846-0543zp8","updated":"20250918123930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叠加、异步加载场景"}]},{"ID":"20250918123856-k7jkrs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123856-k7jkrs9","updated":"20250918123857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路："}]},{"ID":"20250918123859-b6vre15","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123859-b6vre15","updated":"20250918123917"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123901-3iic3b5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123901-3iic3b5","updated":"20250918123917"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123901-iqesxdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123901-iqesxdg","updated":"20250918123917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方式一：利用 Unity 自带API"}]},{"ID":"20250918123903-slsxvci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123903-slsxvci","updated":"20250918123908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把大关卡拆成多个子场景，加载场景时按需加载、分时加载、并且在合适的时机激活或卸载场景\n可以利用 Unity 中 SceneManager 中的异步加载场景API，并通过加载模式参数控制是否叠加加载"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123902-a78yw5y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918123902-a78yw5y","updated":"20250918123902"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918123902-94usdnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123902-94usdnt","updated":"20250918123902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方式二：自定义场景编辑器"}]},{"ID":"20250918123913-xcgmqob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123913-xcgmqob","updated":"20250918123913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景为空场景，场景中物件都是通过场景编辑器记录数据，进入场景时所有对象都是动态加载的\n自定义加载策略，在合适的距离时机加载对应场景中物件对象，在合适的时机卸载场景中物件对象"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918123930-p92g2m9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918123930-p92g2m9","updated":"20250918140739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采用合理资源布局"}]},{"ID":"20250918123939-86i4afx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123939-86i4afx","updated":"20250918123954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要思路：在选择 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Resources"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、AB 包、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Addressables"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等资源加载方式时，应采用适合自己项目情况的方案进行资源布局"}]},{"ID":"20250918123958-na6wn1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918123958-na6wn1u","updated":"20250918124001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20250918124001-5ae7ggz","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124001-5ae7ggz","updated":"20250918140521"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124001-q9911dd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124001-q9911dd","updated":"20250918124001"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124001-jr33gjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124001-jr33gjy","updated":"20250918124010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Resources：只适合小体量或原型项目开发，它会打进包、无法热更、依赖不可控、启动时会做索引扫描，建议大项目尽量少用甚至不用"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918124003-01liqav","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124003-01liqav","updated":"20250918140521"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124003-3z1ddla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124003-3z1ddla","updated":"20250918140521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AssetBundle：需要完全自定义下载、缓存、版本策略；工程复杂度较高，但可控性强"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918124005-pkngeg7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124005-pkngeg7","updated":"20250918124005"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124005-zxb7dtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124005-zxb7dtv","updated":"20250918124040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Addressables：官方维护、热更与缓存策略完整、使用方便，可控性不如 AssetBundle"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918124040-8t99hox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124040-8t99hox","updated":"20250918124042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源布局方面"}]},{"ID":"20250918124045-8ed0lg2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124045-8ed0lg2","updated":"20250918140536"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124048-id1zm4j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124048-id1zm4j","updated":"20250918124113"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124048-rnw832z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124048-rnw832z","updated":"20250918124101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 AB 包或 Addressables 时应合理分包"}]},{"ID":"20250918124108-sovww3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124108-sovww3o","updated":"20250918124113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少跨包依赖，包内资源应高度内聚，并且单包大小要适中（移动端常见 1050 MB），并发下载不要超过 35 个"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918124048-4zgschs","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124048-4zgschs","updated":"20250918124048"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124048-5wbxjgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124048-5wbxjgk","updated":"20250918124105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 应该剔除无用关键字，避免过多变体的产生"}]},{"ID":"20250918124106-30pzf3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124106-30pzf3q","updated":"20250918124106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尽量复用材质，可以减少实例化时消耗"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918124048-v1gcpfn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918124048-v1gcpfn","updated":"20250918140536"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918124048-gpx9erx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124048-gpx9erx","updated":"20250918140536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配置表尽量集中化，预设体中不要太多可配置属性，尽量都通过 ID 在配置表中获取数据来复用"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918124044-2dk1f1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918124044-2dk1f1o","updated":"20250918124044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250918140739-zty98ho","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918140739-zty98ho","updated":"20250918144339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预渲染"}]},{"ID":"20250918140830-rr7qll6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140830-rr7qll6","updated":"20250918140849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预渲染的本质是提前生成某些画面结果，然后在需要的时候直接使用结果，主要目的是为了解决："}]},{"ID":"20250918140840-087keya","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918140840-087keya","updated":"20250918140923"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918140840-juzmfvo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918140840-juzmfvo","updated":"20250918140840"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918140840-dlilraf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140840-dlilraf","updated":"20250918140840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 到 GPU 的首帧数据上传"}]},{"ID":"20250918140852-p55jln4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140852-p55jln4","updated":"20250918140859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当一个模型、材质、纹理、网格第一次被真正用于渲染时，CPU 会把它的网格数据、纹理数据、常量缓冲等上传到 GPU 内存\n这个过程是异步的，但首次调用可能会导致主线程等待数据上传完成，玩家可能会在第一次看到该对象时感到掉帧，即首帧卡顿"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918140840-cb3blj4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918140840-cb3blj4","updated":"20250918140923"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918140840-mwedqu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140840-mwedqu1","updated":"20250918140906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader（着色器）首次编译"}]},{"ID":"20250918140909-0kl6rhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140909-0kl6rhk","updated":"20250918140923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 是按需编译的（尤其在多变体 Shader 、URP 、 HDRP 中），\n第一次用到某个 Shader Pass + Keyword 组合 时，Unity 会在运行时编译它，编译过程可能会卡 CPU，尤其在移动设备或低端机上"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918140838-zwa3u0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140838-zwa3u0s","updated":"20250918140928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以总的来说，如果进行了预渲染，真正进入游戏场景时，玩家第一次看到预渲染的游戏对象就不会有卡顿感了"}]},{"ID":"20250918140930-z8tbvj8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250918140930-z8tbvj8","updated":"20250918144339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"隐藏相机 + RenderTexture 进行预渲染"}]},{"ID":"20250918140949-67ocz0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140949-67ocz0k","updated":"20250918141036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般在合适的时机，比如在过场景显示加载界面时（读条界面），我们可以利用 隐藏相机 + "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"RenderTexture"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的形式偷偷的在后台预渲染目标对象\n这样做的目的是不仅可以预渲染目标对象，还可以避免影响玩家体验，基本做法："}]},{"ID":"20250918140955-pptaye6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918140955-pptaye6","updated":"20250918143316"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918140955-tmvvq83","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918140955-tmvvq83","updated":"20250918142813"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918140955-tp6tbfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918140955-tp6tbfr","updated":"20250918142733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建一个新的摄像机，并创建一个专门用于预渲染的层（预渲染摄像机最好只渲染一个专门用于预渲染的层，同时其他摄像机不勾选预渲染层）"}]},{"ID":"20250918142602-rg5py6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918142602-rg5py6z","updated":"20250918142813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250918142701-m4guky9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250918142753-xy4f4u7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918140955-m7rv85o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Mar